xt Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1669106429497" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1669106429497"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-left-lg gf-elm-left-md gf-elm-left-sm gf-elm-left-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; text-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 0px;">（写真左）</span></p><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; text-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 0px;">■中島潤さん</span><br></p><p>・事務局長兼キャリア事業部シニアマネージャー</p><p>・藥師さんの友人であり同僚。</p><p>　思いやりあふれる、組織コミュニケーションの要。</p></div></div></div></div><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" data-atomgroup="row" id="r-1669106866858" class="gf_row gf_row-gap-10" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1669106866858" data-layout-lg="3+9" data-extraclass="" data-layout-md="3+9" data-layout-sm="3+9" data-layout-xs="3+9" data-row-gap="10px"><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-3 gf_col-md-3 gf_col-sm-3 gf_col-xs-3" id="c-1669106370832" data-id="1669106370832"><div data-label="Image" data-key="image" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1669106866799" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-image" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1669106866799" data-resolution="3000x3000"><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf_elm-left-xs gf-elm-right-lg gf-elm-right-md gf-elm-right-sm gf-elm-right-xs" data-exc=""><img src="https://ucarecdn.com/cd98765f-b78c-4952-b097-4eddfe5711d8/-/format/auto/-/preview/3000x3000/-/quality/lighter/KK_REBIT2-2_sato.jpg" alt="" class="gf_image" data-gemlang="en" width="665" height="665" data-width="50%" data-height="auto" title="" natural-width="665" natural-height="665"></div></div></div><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-9 gf_col-md-9 gf_col-sm-9 gf_col-xs-9" id="c-1669106381331" data-id="1669106381331"><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1669106866822" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" da